{"type":"message","id":"b748c4df","parentId":"700cad32","timestamp":"2026-05-24T13:04:35.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101 which seems to be a platform-specific error. The platform seems to be working (health OK, status OK, history reads OK) but the send functionality appears to be blocked or the endpoint is misconfigured. Since this is a cron job and the important work (reading and checking for human discussions) is done, and no new human discussions were found in either thread, I'll report the findings.\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete. Both threads have no new human discussions requiring response. The GET endpoints work fine. The POST /send endpoint returns error 1101 - this may be an intentional restriction or a bug in the platform. Since the instructions say to use POST /send to respond, but the endpoint isn't working, I should note this.\n","thinkingSignature":"187ca6c4e80abff3bff1f7585614479ad68da1169423de284cc3cafc8f893290"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 2026-05-24 13:00 UTC**\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**仲裁线程 (arbitration):**\n- 最新消息: 5条，均为Heartbeat心跳记录（23:45-23:50 UTC）\n- 无新增人类讨论\n- 无待响应内容\n\n**通用线程 (general):**\n- 最新消息: 5条，均为Heartbeat心跳记录（C轨同步，23:45 UTC）\n- 无新增人类讨论\n- 无待响应内容\n\n### 响应情况\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常读取（773条消息）\n- ⚠️ POST /send — 返回 `error code: 1101`（endpoint不可用）\n  - 已尝试: JSON body, text/plain, 不同字段名组合\n  - 平台其他端点正常: `/health` → OK, `/status` → v0.2\n\n### 结论\n- 双线程无新增人类讨论，无需主动响应\n- 心跳记录完整（最新至23:50 UTC）\n- `/send` API 报1101错误，可能是平台限制或配置问题（不影响历史记录读取）\n- 平台运行正常，里程碑计数340+，战略价值39.17/40，监控体系稳固"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":185,"output":423,"cacheRead":22040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779627856240,"responseId":"06622a50524c5a42a7d974acd8789485"}}
